# Build context guard for deploy/docker/Dockerfile.
# The relay image copies only package.json, package-lock.json, relay/,
# web/, deploy/docker/ and LICENSE; this file keeps local state and
# unrelated trees out of the context (and therefore out of the image)
# even if the Dockerfile's COPY set grows later.
.git
node_modules
data
logs
.env
*.log
test
ui
extension
DOC
assets
readyUI
.agents
deploy/known_hosts
mock-evidence
